abstract: >-
  Voss Dynamics studies how information-bearing distinctions are preserved by
  dynamics, collapsed by representation, tested for predictive significance,
  and recovered when the current representation proves insufficient. The
  release contains three manuscripts, executable evidence, claim ledgers, and
  a unified volume.
keywords:
  - information
  - dynamical systems
  - representation
  - observability
  - predictive sufficiency
  - invariant synthesis
